1
00:00:00,245 --> 00:00:04,176
Refund Office is designed for a small shop handling refund requests.

2
00:00:04,540 --> 00:00:06,649
A customer reports a missing item.

3
00:00:07,304 --> 00:00:11,357
Someone must find the order, compare the packing record, apply the

4
00:00:11,367 --> 00:00:13,894
refund policy and record a decision.

5
00:00:14,838 --> 00:00:17,237
This miniature office makes that work visible.

6
00:00:20,221 --> 00:00:23,294
This local demonstration uses synthetic records.

7
00:00:23,832 --> 00:00:27,491
The worker picks up a saved request from the queue, investigates

8
00:00:27,501 --> 00:00:29,401
it and hands the result to Review.

9
00:00:29,939 --> 00:00:32,385
The desks show stages of one workflow.

10
00:00:32,830 --> 00:00:34,811
Local rules power this run;

11
00:00:35,175 --> 00:00:37,992
the prepared AI connections remain switched off.

12
00:00:40,221 --> 00:00:42,829
The first case concerns a missing travel mug.

13
00:00:43,368 --> 00:00:46,655
The order prices it at twenty pounds, and the packing record

14
00:00:46,665 --> 00:00:47,915
shows it was omitted.

15
00:00:48,453 --> 00:00:51,786
The worker prepares a twenty pound recommendation with evidence

16
00:00:51,796 --> 00:00:52,709
references.

17
00:00:53,840 --> 00:00:56,703
Open the evidence to check where that amount came from.

18
00:01:00,221 --> 00:01:04,054
Policy checks examine the evidence, amount, previous remedies and

19
00:01:04,064 --> 00:01:05,175
refund limit.

20
00:01:05,829 --> 00:01:08,692
A supported recommendation still waits for a person.

21
00:01:09,231 --> 00:01:13,237
Every refund requires explicit approval tied to the case and

22
00:01:13,247 --> 00:01:14,230
its facts.

23
00:01:15,360 --> 00:01:19,164
We leave this one awaiting that decision, with no payment submitted.

24
00:01:20,187 --> 00:01:23,131
A second case cannot support a recommendation yet.

25
00:01:23,368 --> 00:01:27,085
The packing record shows two different missing items, but the complaint

26
00:01:27,095 --> 00:01:29,459
does not identify which one is claimed.

27
00:01:29,823 --> 00:01:32,048
The office holds it for clarification.

28
00:01:33,178 --> 00:01:35,496
A reviewer records an evidence request;

29
00:01:35,941 --> 00:01:38,131
this rehearsal contacts no customer.

30
00:01:40,197 --> 00:01:43,866
We record a fictional reply naming the sketchbook, with its source

31
00:01:43,876 --> 00:01:45,201
and a reviewer reason.

32
00:01:46,266 --> 00:01:48,340
Saving it queues another investigation.

33
00:01:48,755 --> 00:01:52,063
The original complaint and packing record stay unchanged.

34
00:01:52,566 --> 00:01:56,622
The result is a ten pound recommendation, again waiting for approval.

35
00:01:57,236 --> 00:01:59,651
The clarification supplied the missing detail.

36
00:02:00,187 --> 00:02:03,712
Download the decision brief for a record you can inspect afterwards.

37
00:02:04,842 --> 00:02:08,791
It keeps the original complaint, clarification, sources, policy

38
00:02:08,801 --> 00:02:11,038
checks and investigation history together.

39
00:02:11,692 --> 00:02:14,904
It also states that the refund has no human approval.

40
00:02:15,349 --> 00:02:17,760
You can see which decision is still outstanding.

41
00:02:20,187 --> 00:02:24,147
The extra case canvas connects the saved sources, investigation,

42
00:02:24,157 --> 00:02:25,442
policy and decision.

43
00:02:26,235 --> 00:02:30,283
Search the records or ask a question, then follow its citations.

44
00:02:30,937 --> 00:02:33,719
Answers use saved records and local rules.

45
00:02:34,374 --> 00:02:37,347
Moving a card changes the view, never the case or your

46
00:02:37,357 --> 00:02:38,026
decision.

47
00:02:40,198 --> 00:02:44,247
A separate local evaluation compares expected and observed outcomes

48
00:02:44,287 --> 00:02:48,018
for sixty two synthetic cases: five hundred and eight checks

49
00:02:48,028 --> 00:02:48,776
passed.

50
00:02:49,568 --> 00:02:51,764
Correct holds count as passes, too.

51
00:02:52,417 --> 00:02:54,579
This checks the original local engine.

52
00:02:55,371 --> 00:02:58,986
Live providers remain untested, and the shop controls every

53
00:02:58,996 --> 00:02:59,687
refund.
